{
  "slug": "5-steps-to-take-after-a-truck-accident",
  "title": "5 Steps to Take After a Truck Accident",
  "excerpt": "Collisions involving large trucks are on the rise in the United States. After a 34% decrease in fatal truck crashes between 2005 and 2009, fatality rates jumped 40% between 2009 and 2017. The effects of a crash can be devastating. You should know how to protect yourself and your potential claim after a truck accident. […]",
  "publishedAt": "2019-12-27T08:00:59",
  "modifiedAt": "2025-06-06T12:40:01",
  "categories": [
    "truck-accidents"
  ],
  "body": [
    {
      "_type": "image",
      "_key": "iceq",
