          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "scga",
          "text": ". Then, we can determine liability using evidence such as trucking logs, drug and alcohol screening results and maintenance logs.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bcgg",
